<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I’m in the library, looking at books,</l><l>If I make a noise then I get funny looks.</l><l>Shhhhh... This is when we’re quiet.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Today’s our meeting, my friends have all come,</l><l>We’ve sung and we’ve chatted, now story’s begun.</l><l>Shhhhh... This is when we’re quiet.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
